			"updated": 1771872539499,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "TRAP 1  Passing [1000000]int to a function copies 8MB on the stack -> goroutine stack overflow!\nTRAP 2  [5]int != [4]int - different types, cannot assign or pass to same function parameter\nTRAP 3  for i,v := range a  ->  v is a COPY - modifying v does not modify a[i]. Use a[i] directly.",
			"fontSize": 13,
			"fontFamily": 3,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
