			"originalText": "TRAP 1  Passing [1000000]int to a function copies 8MB on the stack -> goroutine stack overflow!\nTRAP 2  [5]int != [4]int - different types, cannot assign or pass to same function parameter\nTRAP 3  for i,v := range a  ->  v is a COPY - modifying v does not modify a[i]. Use a[i] directly.",
