			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "MENTAL MODEL: An array is a fixed-size value - like an int but with N slots.\n   A slice is a view into an array. arr[:] converts array to slice in O(1) - no copy!\nUSE ARRAYS: [32]byte for SHA256, [16]byte for UUID, ring buffers, small lookup tables",
			"fontSize": 13,
			"fontFamily": 3,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "MENTAL MODEL: An array is a fixed-size value - like an int but with N slots.\n   A slice is a view into an array. arr[:] converts array to slice in O(1) - no copy!\nUSE ARRAYS: [32]byte for SHA256, [16]byte for UUID, ring buffers, small lookup tables",
